{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">對於想在下班後或辦公室午膳時間享用新鮮自家飯菜，卻又不想開火煮食的打工仔來說，燜燒杯絕對是絕佳幫手！在TVB節目《食好D 食平D》中，肥媽親自教授如何利用燜燒杯，全程無火煮出健康美味的「番薯南瓜燕麥粥」，做法非常簡單，只需三個步驟即可完成！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>準備材料</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">番薯</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">南瓜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">燕麥片</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>無火烹調3步曲</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"f8cc476c-dc38-4e92-ba67-12d3a0bb6436.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026CeYGcKFMwm1786959867.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f8cc476c-dc38-4e92-ba67-12d3a0bb6436.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"a15f5cfe-1dba-4089-bd37-9b4db1051da3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026sMGtXuoQDT1786959871.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a15f5cfe-1dba-4089-bd37-9b4db1051da3.jpg.webp\"/><br/